{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play a game of \u201cEternal Night\u201d solitaire, set in a spooky Halloween environment.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Haunting backgrounds and matching card decks create a suspenseful atmosphere, accompanied by atmospheric music.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You\u2019ll quickly master both classic and new solitaire variants thanks to easy-to-understand in-game instructions. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Eternal Night Spooky Solitaire&quot; is perfectly suited for fall and winter evenings. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sort cards, enjoy the Halloween spirit, unlock lots of levels \u2014 spooky fun and great entertainment for beginners and advanced players alike!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >    Different solitaire variants</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >    Lots of challenging levels</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >    Hours of entertainment with spooky fun</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >    Different locations and trophies</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >    Easy-to-understand instructions directly in the game for easy handling</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4042390?t=1759164385","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4042390?t=1759164385","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4042390/7a9a7d3d9d7780d4788c444161bf771d90264189/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1759164385","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4042390/7a9a7d3d9d7780d4788c444161bf771d90264189/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1759164385","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play a game of \u201cEternal Night\u201d solitaire, set in a spooky Halloween environment.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Haunting backgrounds and matching card decks create a suspenseful atmosphere, accompanied by atmospheric music.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You\u2019ll quickly master both classic and new solitaire variants thanks to easy-to-understand in-game instructions. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Eternal Night Spooky Solitaire&quot; is perfectly suited for fall and winter evenings. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sort cards, enjoy the Halloween spirit, unlock lots of levels \u2014 spooky fun and great entertainment for beginners and advanced players alike!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >    Different solitaire variants</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >    Lots of challenging levels</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >    Hours of entertainment with spooky fun</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >    Different locations and trophies</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >    Easy-to-understand instructions directly in the game for easy handling</p></li></ul>","developers":["magnussoft"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4042390/ea7e16122f9ffe144b3738dc0ed37aed31535ce8/header.jpg?t=1759164385","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4042390/697253689/33cd852ef1c1a6600799bde7576f606fcd2dab0b/1758122244/dash_av1.mpd?t=1759164383","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4042390/697253689/33cd852ef1c1a6600799bde7576f606fcd2dab0b/1758122244/dash_h264.mpd?t=1759164383","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4042390/697253689/33cd852ef1c1a6600799bde7576f606fcd2dab0b/175812224